<div class="container py-4">
  <h1 class="page-title">What Is Domestic & Gender-Based Violence?</h1>

  <div class="row g-4 mt-1">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h4 text-danger"><i class="bi bi-house-exclamation"></i> Domestic Violence</h2>
        <p>Abuse by a spouse, former spouse, family member or someone living in the same home. In Malaysia it is covered by the Domestic Violence Act 1994.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h4 text-danger"><i class="bi bi-gender-ambiguous"></i> Gender-Based Violence</h2>
        <p>Harm directed at a person because of their gender, including sexual harassment, stalking, sexual assault and abuse, in any setting.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-5 mb-3">Forms of Abuse</h2>
  <div class="row g-3">
    <% [["bi-bandaid", "Physical", "Hitting, slapping, choking or using weapons."],
        ["bi-emoji-frown", "Emotional", "Insults, threats, humiliation and constant control."],
        ["bi-exclamation-octagon", "Sexual", "Any unwanted sexual act or pressure."],
        ["bi-cash-coin", "Financial", "Controlling money or stopping someone from working."],
        ["bi-person-x", "Social Isolation", "Cutting the victim off from family and friends."]].each do |icon, title, text| %>
      <div class="col-6 col-lg">
        <div class="type-box text-center p-3 h-100">
          <i class="bi <%= icon %> fs-2 text-danger"></i>
          <h3 class="h6 mt-2"><%= title %></h3>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-0"><%= text %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-warning mt-5">
    <h2 class="h5"><i class="bi bi-eye"></i> Warning Signs</h2>
    <ul class="mb-0">
      <li>Unexplained injuries or frequent "accidents"</li>
      <li>Fear of a partner or family member</li>
      <li>Withdrawal from friends, work or studies</li>
      <li>Partner checks their phone, money or movements</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
